ny people when they ripped down Portland, when they ripped down many other cities. They destroyed and deleted all of the information they found because they found out we were right. And the fact of the matter is, what he's telling you is simply not true. After a jury convicted you of 34 felonies last month, you said if reelected you would, quote, have every right to go after, unquote, your political opponents. We're going to make this country successful again because right now it's a failing nation. President Biden, you have said, I'm coming right to you, sir. It's simply a lie, number one. I didn't have sex with a porn star, number one. President Biden, you have said, quote, Donald Trump and his MAGA Republicans are determined to destroy American democracy. And there's not more coming. Jake, both of you know that sir has been totally wiped out because when you see the sentence, it said 100 percent exoneration on that. It happened. We're going to be right back with more from the CNN presidential debate. And you'd certainly face again in a second term. The fact of the matter is there's more small black businesses that have been started than any time in history. For example, I provided for the idea that any black family first time homebuyers should get a $10,000 tax credit He caused the inflation and it's killing black families and Hispanic families and just about everybody. Fifty percent unemployment. He decimated the economy. Absolutely decimated the economy. Twenty twenty three was the hottest year in recorded history and communities across the country are confronting the devastating effects of extreme heat, Almost every police group in the nation from every state is supporting Donald J. Trump. President Trump, will you take any action as president to slow the climate crisis? And we had it. We had H2O. I passed the most extensive, most extensive climate change legislation in history. It was a ripoff of the United States. And I ended it because I didn't want to wast